            "type": "stream",
            "text": "\nDegree Matrix:\n[[2 0 0 0 0 0]\n [0 3 0 0 0 0]\n [0 0 3 0 0 0]\n [0 0 0 3 0 0]\n [0 0 0 0 3 0]\n [0 0 0 0 0 2]]\n"
