        "cell_type": "code",
        "source": "edges = []\n\nfor i in range(len(labels)):\n\n    for j in range(i + 1, len(labels)):\n\n        if A[i, j] == 1:\n\n            edges.append((i, j))\n\n\nprint(\"\\nEdges:\")\n\nfor u, v in edges:\n\n    print(labels[u], \"-\", labels[v])\n\n",
